        "comment_at": "2026-11-25T15:06:43Z",
        "comment_author": "songqing-sq",
        "comment_body": "Please fetch the HA schema from `sonic-net/sonic-dash-api` rather than the personal fork. `MODULE.bazel:81` currently downloads `https://codeload.github.com/securely1g/sonic-dash-api/tar.gz/18a29c1c8a21aeb22a4893c786564acaf8212156`. This is an actual source input, and the same commit is available through sonic-net. Please use `https://codeload.github.com/sonic-net/sonic-dash-api/tar.gz/18a29c1c8a21aeb22a4893c786564acaf8212156`, preserving the selected revision and verifying the archive checksum."
    },
