    {
        "number": 74,
        "repo": "sonic-dash-api",
        "comment_at": "2026-11-26T05:35:07Z",
        "comment_author": "securely1g",
        "comment_body": "Fixed the [HA schema source request](https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-dash-api/pull/74#issuecomment-7166319673) in 7c4a198. Bazel now fetches commit `18a29c1` from `sonic-net/sonic-dash-api`. I downloaded and compared both archives byte for byte. Their SHA-256 is `38b8f846fb6191f9315da3df8ea7285881726c1507dc26d0d73a78c17fbf96c3`.\n\nBazel 8.5.1 passed `//bazel:ha_schema_test` on AMD64, generating the descriptor with the pinned protoc 3.21.12. All three source hashes matched, and `HaScopeConfigKey` preserved field 1 for `ha_scope_id` and field 2 for `vdpu_id`.\n"
    },
